# L §8.3 LOAD-REPLACE (round 12b): "replace <x>[keys]: no earlier row to replace (in a scenario, no base row at those
# keys either)": the scenario replaces bonus, which no row of the base or the scenario states.
=== hh.tally
model hh
  tally 2
  on 2026-11-15
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2027-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input salary: money PLN
input bonus: money PLN

version v1
  cite s
  governs 2026-01-01..
  known 2026-01-01
  salary = 5 000.00 PLN "umowa"

version v2
  cite s
  governs 2027-01-01..
  known 2026-11-01
  replace salary = 6 000.00 PLN "aneks"

ask b: salary law 2027-06-30
=== stop.tally
scenario stop over hh
  tally 2
  from 2027-01-01

version stop_salary
  cite s
  governs 2027-01-01..
  known 2026-10-20
  replace bonus = 0 PLN "założenie"

ask s1: bonus in stop law 2027-06-30
ask s2: bonus in stop law 2026-06-30
=== expect
scenario stop: refused: LOAD-REPLACE replace bonus: no earlier row to replace (stop.tally:9)
...
